Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿  嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不准这样  还在我屋里  就得守规矩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}None of that. Not while you're living under my roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算我知道内幕  也不代表我喜欢看你们亲热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, just because I know about you two doesn't mean I like looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你试镜不是还有一小时才结束吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aren't you supposed to be at an audition for another hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.43,0:00:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  我可不是中年黑人妇女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm sorry if I'm not a middle-aged black woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还走错试镜场地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm also sorry if sometimes I go to the wrong audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要我假装不知道  就得假装你们没怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look, if I have to pretend I don't know about you two,then you two are gonna have to pretend there's nothing to know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.37,0:00:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.21,0:00:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋还在上班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel's at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是听得到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can still hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.35,0:01:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第06集  雪男\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E06   The One With The Yeti
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.41,0:01:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.79,0:01:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈寄给我外婆的祖传宝物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, my mom sent me a family heirloom that once belonged to my grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们相信吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一年前我连家人都没有  现在竟然有祖传家产\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A year ago I didn't even have a family,and now I have heirlooms for crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.21,0:02:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好软\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是貂皮吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is this mink?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我妈为何寄皮草给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! Why would my mother send me a fur?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.47,0:02:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她完全不了解我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Doesn't she know me but at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.55,0:02:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经有外套了  而且还没牺牲任何可怜动物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plus, I have a perfectly fine coat that no innocent animals suffered to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.27,0:02:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是时薪12分钱的九岁菲律宾童工\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, just some 9-year-old Filipino kids who worked their fingers bloody...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卖命做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...for 12 cents an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.98,0:02:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别听我的  我胡说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That didn't happen, I made that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.41,0:02:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.57,0:02:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你不能在这里贴广告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, you can't put up flyers in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  别人都可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How come? Everybody else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要处理掉一些家具\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, uh, I'm getting rid of a couple of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.59,0:02:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你所有家当\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is all of your things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  艾蜜莉说  我们应该买新家具\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, but it's good. Emily thinks we should get all new stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光属于我们俩的家具  也都是全新的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stuff that's just ours. Together, you know, brand new.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,基本上这是 "瑞秋碰过的家具" 大拍卖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So basically this is a "getting rid of anything Rachel ever touched" sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.11,0:03:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摸过  用过  坐过  睡过的都不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Touched, used, sat on, slept on...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我全买了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll take it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你不反对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Ross, you're okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.11,0:03:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要顺着艾蜜莉  她来纽约就没事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, if I can just do what Emily wants,and get her to New York, I'm sure everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  这种做法也太极端了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but don't you think that's a little extreme?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟是我说错名字  你能怪她吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}After what I did, can you blame her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经算轻松了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. You got off easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我朋友席薇的老公在床上喊错名字  她就把他的小弟弟变绿了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When my friend Sylvie's husband said someone else's name in bed,she cursed him and turned his thingy green.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他这是做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉觉得罗斯的家具  会沾上瑞秋的虱子吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emily thinks Ross' furniture has got Rachel cooties?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  别激动  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Calm down, Joey. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我偏要  事情搞得乱七八糟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everything's getting all messed up, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉不准罗斯见瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emily won't let Ross see Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我们会继续见瑞秋  因此罗斯再也不能见我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not gonna stop seeing Rachel, hence, Ross stops seeing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不开心  一切都变了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I hate this. Everything's changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我们不能再见罗斯  乔伊还会用 "因此"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I know. We're losing Ross, Joey said "hence."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not happy about this either,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  如果罗斯能开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but, you know, if Ross says he's happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不该说出  自己对艾蜜莉的心情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then we just have to keep our feelings about Emily to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家愿意吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you cool with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我是演员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, you know, I'm an actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以装得无所谓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll act cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.73,0:04:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我怕死储藏室了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh. Oh, God, storage rooms give me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  拜托  你快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, please, hurry up, honey, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你要吃小圆松饼  就得让我先找到煎盘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, if you want the little round waffles, you gotta have to wait until I find the little waffle iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想吃小圆松饼  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want the little round waffles. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在杀虫药下面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right underneath the can of bug bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,锅碗瓢盆怎么可以  放在毒药下面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wonder if the best place to put something that cooks food is underneath the can of poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我吃土司好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you know what? I'll have toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  喷他喷他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh my God! Fog him! Fog him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该如何处置这件皮草\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what I'm gonna do about this coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好主意  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That might work. Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好  怎样  你们觉得如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh? All right, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟后换你上台  明妮莉小姐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're on in five, Ms. Minnelli.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  只是有点突然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no, it's just a bit sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我很高兴  也全力赞成\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's great, okay? I am totally on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你  好  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you too. All right, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the matter, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.51,0:05:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  其实是件好消息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing. Oh, actually, great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.01,0:05:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚跟艾蜜莉通过电话  看来我要搬家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, just got off the phone with Emily,and looks like I'm moving to a new apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.27,0:06:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  她认为  而且我也同意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Well, her thought is... And I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.19,0:06:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然要换新家具  干脆也换间公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fresh new furniture, why not a fresh new apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.66,0:06:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她表妹有个地方要分租\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Her cousin has this great place to sublet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一边可以看到河  一边可以看到哥伦比亚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's got a view of the river on one side and Columbia on the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是离市区很远的地方  大概要转搭三种车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's way uptown. That's like three trains away...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...which is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢搭火车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love to ride that rail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的同意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you're really okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.55,0:06:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  离上班地点是有点远\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, yes. I mean, it's kind of far from work...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我通勤时就有很多时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but, uh, you know, I'll get so much done on the commute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她算是送了我一份大礼  那就是时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been given the gift of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.47,0:06:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真有意思  上次圣诞节  我还得到很多空间呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's so funny, because last Christmas I got the gift of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两样加起来就是有个小宇宙了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We should get them together and make a continuum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在还要搬家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now he's moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉到底施了什么法啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, what is Emily doing to him? Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他又不在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's not even here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家听我们说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys. You guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:07:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚刚去储藏室  看到一个很可怕的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were just in the storage area and we saw this really creepy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目露凶光  全身毛茸茸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He was like this crazy-eyed, hairy beast-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.09,0:07:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像大脚哈利或是喜马拉雅雪人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He was like a Bigfoot or a yeti or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他还拿着斧头  瑞秋只好拿杀虫药喷他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He came at us with an ax, so Rachel had to use the bug bomb on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我拉开拉环拼命喷他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I pulled the tab and I just fogged his yeti ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,深色头发  满脸胡须  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, like, dark hair, bushy beard? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们喷的是丹尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you fogged Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.81,0:07:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  才不是丹尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, please. We did not fog Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who's Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼刚搬到楼下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Danny just moved in downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.07,0:07:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙去安地斯山四个月  才刚回国  人很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He just got back from this four-month trek in the Andes. Nice fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么人很好  每次我们喷谁  你就帮他说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, he's nice. He's nice. You know, you always stick up for the people we fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah? Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你大概不记得  我们就是上次喷你的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You might not remember us, but we are the girls that fogged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.93,0:08:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们很抱歉  乱喷一通\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're really sorry we fogged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  我们只是要告诉你  我们不是故意的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, uh, just so you know, we didn't mean to fog you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们以为你是雪人还是怪物什么的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We actually thought you were like a yeti or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.37,0:08:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  抱歉打扰你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Ahem, sorry to bother you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.54,0:08:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你接受我们道歉的态度  让我们很不爽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I don't think that we can accept your acceptance of our apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.17,0:08:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来一点也不真心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It just doesn't really seem like you mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙真恶劣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. That guy is so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.39,0:08:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  他哪里有病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really. What is with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换做我喷你  你早就原谅我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you'd forgive me if I fogged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  你有喷到我  一点点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you did, a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, honey. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全不介意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I totally forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.61,0:08:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  我那个开火葬场的朋友克里斯吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So listen, you know my friend Chris who owns the crematorium?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火葬场那个克里斯  当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Crematorium Chris? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说他愿意免费帮我烧皮草\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, he said that he would cremate my fur coat for free...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要我介绍死人去他那里火化\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...if I, um, you know, bring in the next person I know who dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  好漂亮的皮草\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.Oh, my God. Look at these pelts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.27,0:09:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别太喜欢了  她要烧掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't get too attached. She's having it cremated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.81,0:09:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe? Ha. Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是个怪胎  大家平时也欣赏你这点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, I know you're quirky, and I get a big kick out of it. We all do, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你毁掉这么棒的皮草  实在是不合天理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But if you destroy a coat like this,I mean, that is like a crime against nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说错了  是有违时尚流行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not nature. Fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这叫做流行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is fashion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尸体叫做流行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so to you, death is fashion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实在有意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's really funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来菲比为各位展示  最新的毛茸茸尸体\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here's Phoebe umm, sporting uh, y'know, cutting edge hairy carcass
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些动物死于寒冷的俄罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...from, you know, the steel traps of wintry Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们真认为好看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you really think this looks good?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.77,0:10:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我觉得不赖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想念你  希望快点见到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I miss you too. I can't wait to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.73,0:10:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这什么  石头吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, what is in here, rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.91,0:10:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我收集的化石样本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, this is my collection of, uh, fossil samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是石头嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会想念这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm really gonna miss this apartment. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小班就在那边学会走路的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, Ben took his first steps right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记不记得我上次撞到这里  后来还昏倒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, remember when I ran into this thing and it kind of knocked me out a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.22,0:10:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很喜欢这间公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  我真希望别搬家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To tell you the truth, I wish I didn't have to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是你也不想走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, are you saying that you're not entirely happy about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:11:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果艾蜜莉给我选择的机会  你本来就有机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I mean, if, uh, Emily gave me a choice. You do have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你为什么要听她的  你疯了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, why are you listening to her? Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.74,0:11:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉这些要求太过分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not right what Emily wants you to do
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她根本就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She is totally
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要再捏我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop pinching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都说只要罗斯快乐  我就不该大嘴巴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys said I only had to keep my mouth shut as long as Ross was happy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.51,0:11:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是  他刚说他也不开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, he just told me that he's not entirely happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.93,0:11:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都讨厌艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We all hate Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才怪  不  罗斯  我们不讨厌艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, Ross, we do not hate Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是认为你为了讨她开心  牺牲太多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We just think that you're having to sacrifice a whole lot to make her happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.36,0:11:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都认为她有点不可理喻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We just think that maybe she's being a little unreasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  就是不可理喻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, yes, unreasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可理喻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unreasonable?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.37,0:11:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是以后你们谁结婚  大伙也有这种反应呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about we have this conversation when one of you guys gets married?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.54,0:11:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们根本不知道如何维持婚姻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have no idea what it takes to make a marriage work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婚姻就是互相妥协  永远都会开心吗  不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's about compromise. Do you always like it? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你愿意吗   愿意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you do it? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为婚姻不是只有欢乐  只有梦幻  只管上咖啡馆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because it's not all laughing, happy, candy in the sky,drinking coffee at Central Perk all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婚姻是真实生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's real life, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.22,0:12:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婚姻只适合成年人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's what grownups do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说得有道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们太常泡咖啡馆了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys hang out at the coffeehouse way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对罗斯很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, I feel so guilty about Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得似乎都怪我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I kind of feel like it's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,似乎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kind of?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不是你大嘴巴  也不会有这种下场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you just kept this to yourself, none of this would have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最近知道的秘密太多  总有说溜嘴的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm keeping so many things to myself these days,something was bound to slip out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实你很勇敢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I think it's very brave what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我坐不住了  我得去走走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't sit here anymore. I have to walk places.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你怎么还穿那件外套   你不是关心动物吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, what are you doing with the coat? How about the whole animal rights thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最近读了一些书  告诉你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, ahem, I've been reading up, and for your information...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,貂不是好动物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...minks are not very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我承认  我喜欢这件外套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I admit it. I love this coat, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是裹在我身上最棒的东西  菲尔亨利都不够好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's the best thing I've ever had wrapped around me, including Phil Huntley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得菲尔吗   他帅呆了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Remember Phil Huntley? He was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来你比较喜欢短发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you like the short hair better?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.15,0:13:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雪人  你是丹尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeti? Uh, Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得剪头发  因为杀虫剂的味道太浓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had to cut my hair to get rid of the,fogger smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我绝对不会再乱喷了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I'm so sorry. I would have never fogged you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.45,0:13:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不是你的样子实在太像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you know, if you hadn't looked so... You know, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:13:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些人只会以貌取人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Some people are just into appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   没关系  无所谓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? That's cool. That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.71,0:14:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  等等  什么无所谓  你根本不认识我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What...? Hey, whoa, no, no, no, that is not cool.You don't even know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你提着一堆购物袋  还拿着百货公司目录\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. You got the shopping bags and the Saks catalogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.97,0:14:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为这样就能看透我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So from that, you think you've got me all figured out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.81,0:14:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好我的袋子里装满  要给贫困儿童的玩具\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I could have toys for underprivileged kids in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们喜欢拿紧身裤当玩具\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you know, if kids like to play with capri pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.49,0:14:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不准你再说这个字   讨厌你老这么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And stop saying that. I hate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我不该光看你外表\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine! I judged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.97,0:14:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时我只能靠第一印象  可是你也一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I made a snap judgement. But you did it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.18,0:14:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你更糟糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and you're worse...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你只相信第一印象\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because you are sticking to your stupid snap judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.97,0:14:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至不肯反省自己对不对  你有什么资格说别人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't even open up your mind for a second to see that you might be wrong.What does that say about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.06,0:15:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对面那家披萨店好吃吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That pizza place across the street any good?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.15,0:15:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我饿了  要不要去吃彼萨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? I'm hungry. You wanna get some pizza?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还想骂人也可以继续吼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can keep yelling if there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.40,0:15:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便  不准你再说这个字  讨厌你老这么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Stop saying that. I hate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还在生我们的气吗  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you still mad at us? Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.38,0:15:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  因为我们写了一首 "很抱歉" 的歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good, because we have an "I'm Sorry" song. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你们  我现在心情不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? I'm really not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  我很难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Ross.I feel really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你生活发生巨大改变  而我却在乱讲话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you're going through all this stuff,and I just acted like a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们都很对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, we are so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.77,0:15:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们说出歌词了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're stepping on the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们实在太离谱了  其实  我们都站在你这边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, we were way out of line, all right? We totally support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.11,0:15:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无论你做出什么决定  我们都赞成\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whatever you decide, whatever you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,歌词都被你们说完了  我还唱什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, now you're just taking lines right out of the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.82,0:15:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搬家已经够难过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, this is hard enough, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  真的很需要你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really need you guys right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.74,0:16:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  所以我们才要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, exactly. And that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚过来  我帮你煮几道你爱吃的菜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you come over tonight, and I'll make you your favorite dinner? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.55,0:16:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你身上这件是貂皮吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, are you wearing fur?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.43,0:16:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再大惊小怪了  这又不是用导盲犬的皮做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, let's get some perspective, people.It's not like I'm wearing a seeing-eye dog coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  我知道  我为什么突然爆发了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, Ross, I, uh, think I kind of understand why I lost it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是个演员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you see, um...I'm an actor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我的情绪比较丰富  你了解吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I gotta keep my emotions right at the surface, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要同时面临多种情绪  你懂吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got a lot of balls in the air, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这种人的生活实在不容易  必须到处流浪   孤孤单单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's tough. Guys like me, you know, you wander around, you're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.34,0:16:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你胡说什么啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不晓得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.09,0:16:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  回来了  你刚上哪去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hey, look at you. Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:17:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去吃彼萨   跟丹尼去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I went to have pizza. With Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.85,0:17:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.14,0:17:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个雪人口才真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That yeti is one smooth talker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.65,0:17:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你还吃得下  因为晚餐快好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hope you're not too full, because dinner's almost ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我回房间去就好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you know, I think I'm probably just gonna hang out in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是艾蜜莉知道  我跟你们一起吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, if Emily knew I was here having dinner with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.57,0:17:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一定会抓狂  你们也很清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}she would flip out, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  我无所谓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay. I really... I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  请你留下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, wait, wait. You know what? Just stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.13,0:17:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你留下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It would really mean a lot for me if you stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.13,0:17:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  拜托你  跟我们一起吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, I just...Rachel, please, just have dinner with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.85,0:17:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好好  乔伊  别激动  对不起  抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Joey, it's okay. Settle down.All right. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  因为我是演员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You see, Rach, I'm an actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看  那个光屁股的丑八怪  又出现了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, look. Ugly naked guy's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好久没看到他了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We haven't seen him in so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我真想念这个死胖子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God. I really missed that fat bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.45,0:18:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可真诡异\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. This is so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚想到这可能是  大家最后一次一起鬼混\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just realized this may be the last time we're all hanging out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他似乎也知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's almost as if he knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来接\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.89,0:18:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在这里  你等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, uh, you tracked him down. Hold on one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.69,0:18:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.61,0:18:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们正在吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah, we're, uh, just having dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.74,0:18:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你等等  她跟大家打招呼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, yeah, sure, hold on.She wants to say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.41,0:18:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  大家好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有谁在啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So who am I saying hello to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这里有谁  不过瑞秋肯定不在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, uh, I don't know about who's here,but I can tell you for damn sure who's not here, and that's Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.55,0:19:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好是这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I should hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯应该很清楚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross knows better than that by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.77,0:19:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实瑞秋也在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? Uh, Rachel is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.27,0:19:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她也在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  她在那边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, there she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.82,0:19:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Yeah, she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.98,0:19:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  切掉扩音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, take me off speakerphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  你怎么可以这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. How could you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我已经把瑞秋的事  说得够清楚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought I'd made my feelings about Rachel perfectly clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.70,0:19:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉  我只是跟朋友吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Emily, I'm just having dinner with my friends, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是喜欢跟她黏在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You obviously can't keep away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.79,0:19:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你太夸张了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.63,0:19:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意为你搬家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I'm moving for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿意为你不见朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm cutting friends out of my life for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.26,0:19:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你  快搭飞机来纽约\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, just get on the plane and come to New York, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就知道我只想跟你在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You'll see you're the only person I want to be with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我在那边  就不会这么紧张了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll feel better when I'm there
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.35,0:19:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也可以随时知道你在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I can know where you are all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.94,0:19:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不可能永远掌握我的行踪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you can't know where I am all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:20:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不信任我  这个婚姻永远有问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, this marriage is never gonna work if you don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能相信我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So... can you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像很顺利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think it's going okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.51,0:20:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他好像在微笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Looks like he's smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.93,0:20:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道  你只看得到他的背影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How can you tell? You can only see the back of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.76,0:20:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然看得出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can totally tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.77,0:20:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here, look, watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.35,0:20:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,微笑  皱眉  微笑  皱眉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Smile. Frown. Smile. Frown.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.86,0:20:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,微笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.91,0:20:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概玩完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I guess that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.79,0:20:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的婚姻完了  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My marriage is over.What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.17,0:21:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.09,0:21:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你  全身发枓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, look at you, you're shivering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.51,0:21:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  需要我们做什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, honey, is there anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以的话  帮我跟阿甘要回家具\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.You can help me get my furniture back from Gunther.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再折磨我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, stop tormenting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是貂   貂很坏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is mink, okay? They're mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.93,0:21:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且貂讨厌松鼠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and they hate squirrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多貂都想被做成貂皮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, you know, most of these probably wanted to be coats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好好  我知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, fine. No, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:21:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:21:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高兴了吧  我快冷死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you happy now? I'm cold.
